'''Fishing''' is a gathering [[Skills|skill]] in EvilQuest used to catch fish and crustaceans. Catches can be cooked with [[Cooking]] to restore [[Hitpoints]].

Like all skills in EvilQuest, Fishing can be trained up to level '''150''', requiring 2,033,749,558 cumulative XP.

