== Overview & Mechanics ==
Fishing is performed by clicking on fishing spots found in water.

=== Equipment ===
To fish, players must carry the required tool in their inventory:
* '''[[Fishing Net]]''' (Level 1): Used to catch [[Raw Shrimp]].
* '''[[Crab Pot]]''' (Level 10 & 50): Used to catch [[Raw Crayfish]] and [[Raw Lobster]].
* '''[[Fishing Rod]]''' (Level 15 & 87): Used with [[Fishing Bait]] to catch [[Raw Sardine]] and [[Raw Oarfish]]. Consumes 1 bait per catch.
* '''[[Harpoon]]''' (Level 35 & 70): Used to catch [[Raw Tuna]] and [[Raw Octopus]].

=== Water Essence ===
Catching fish has a rare chance to award [[Water Essence]] (Item ID 662), an elemental essence used in magic and transmutations. Game data also lists cooking fish as an intended source (''"Rare from Fishing & Cooking"'' and ''"released through careful cooking"'').

