== Fishing Spots ==
* '''[[Shallow Net Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 1): Requires a [[Fishing Net]] to catch [[Raw Shrimp]].
* '''[[Crayfish Pot Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 10): Requires a [[Crab Pot]] to catch [[Raw Crayfish]].
* '''[[River Bait Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 15): Requires a [[Fishing Rod]] and [[Fishing Bait]] to catch [[Raw Sardine]].
* '''[[Tuna Harpoon Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 35): Requires a [[Harpoon]] to catch [[Raw Tuna]].
* '''[[Lobster Pot Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 50): Requires a [[Crab Pot]] to catch [[Raw Lobster]].
* '''[[Coastal Harpoon Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 70): Requires a [[Harpoon]] to catch [[Raw Octopus]].
* '''[[Deep Bait Fishing Spot]]''' (Level 87): Requires a [[Fishing Rod]] and [[Fishing Bait]] to catch [[Raw Oarfish]].

== Synergy with Cooking ==
Raw fish can be cooked using [[Cooking]] to restore [[Hitpoints]].

